# Cloudflare Pages headers
# Cloudflare Pages auto-detects Content-Type from file extension.
# NEVER set Content-Type here — a broad rule (e.g. /* with text/html) overrides
# CSS/JS MIME types, and browsers then block them under nosniff. That bug made
# the site render as unstyled plain HTML.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
